  "bio": "Karol Tattoo is a highly professional tattoo artist based in Mesquita, Brazil, specializing in the subtle elegance of minimalist designs and precise lettering. With an appointment-only policy at their well-maintained home studio, clients can expect an organized and respectful experience. To discuss designs or receive a quote, Karol invites potential clients to reach out via WhatsApp, ensuring clear and direct communication.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Mesquita, Rio De Janeiro, Brazil\n\n• CADA TRAÇO UMA HISTÓRIA \n•📍Nova Iguaçu || 021\n• Orçamentos no link abaixo",
